From 3661bad7ba6f1c15952c7d1a5f700a2956bfbdff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:30:13 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] ci(js-tests): apt-get update before installing Electron deps
 (#259)

The tfgar runners in the infrastructure account (us-east-1) boot an AMI
baked in us-west-2. cloud-init rewrites the apt sources to the instance's
regional mirror on first boot, so the baked package lists no longer match
and `apt-get install` without an update fails ("Package 'libnotify4' has no
installation candidate", probe run 41006168453). js-tests was the only
hermes-hub workflow installing without an update; e2e-desktop-update and
rust-tests already update first.

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .github/workflows/js-tests.yml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/js-tests.yml b/.github/workflows/js-tests.yml
index 3a9e3f953d6..cf12f01160a 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/js-tests.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/js-tests.yml
@@ -39,6 +39,7 @@ jobs:
       - name: Install zsh and a virtual display for Electron
         if: runner.os == 'Linux'
         run: |
+          sudo apt-get update -qq
           sudo apt-get install -y zsh xvfb \
             libgtk-3-0 libnotify4 libnss3 libxss1 libxtst6 \
             xdg-utils libatspi2.0-0 libdrm2 libgbm1 libasound2t64
-- 
2.55.0

